  "claim": "The context-delivery composition. Engineering knowledge — models, rules, decisions — splits into a STANDING POLICY that is always seen and a TASK SLICE retrieved as needed; both feed the actor's context, which drives the action. A dashed POINT-OF-ACTION attachment reasserts important obligations at the moment of action, and for critical decidable obligations becomes a deterministic gate rather than a reminder. Solid path: the essential composition. Dashed attachment: a useful enhancement, not required for the capability.",
  "topology": "Engineering knowledge — models, rules, decisions — feeds two solid load-bearing lanes.\n    STANDING POLICY supplies compact policy that is always seen. TASK SLICE retrieves task-relevant context as\n    needed. Both converge into ACTOR CONTEXT, which the actor carries into the ACTION. One enhancement attaches\n    as a dashed, open-arrowed reinforcement: POINT-OF-ACTION reminders reassert obligations where useful.\n    Context is a reasoning aid, not enforcement: critical decidable properties graduate out of briefing entirely\n    and into deterministic controls.",
